    "This canonical micro tradition needs items that distinguish egalitarian-liberal feminism centered on personal and political autonomy, enabling conditions, substantive equality, democratic inclusion, and accountable public action from classical-liberal feminism, generic social liberalism, and feminism without a liberal autonomy rationale.",
