    "This contextual formation needs ecosystem-sensitive items that distinguish the non-equivalent Anglo-American conservative or neoliberal New Right and European radical-conservative New Right from Conservatism, National Conservatism, Paleoconservatism, Neoconservatism, and Right-Wing Populism without treating the label as a single respondent ideology.",
